  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-01",
      "sectionId": "cover",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-001",
          "type": "cover",
          "eyebrow": {
            "zh": "川西 · 成都 / 黄龙 / 九寨沟",
            "en": "WESTERN SICHUAN · CHENGDU / HUANGLONG / JIUZHAIGOU"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "从黄龙到九寨沟",
            "en": "From Huanglong to Jiuzhaigou"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "沿着水的颜色，记下这趟旅程",
            "en": "Following the colors of the water"
          },
          "date": {
            "zh": "2024.08.07 — 08.12",
            "en": "2024.08.07 — 08.12"
          },
          "intro": {
            "zh": "从上海夜航到成都，再坐火车去镇江关。相册里，黄龙的钙华池接着九寨沟的湖和瀑布；有些返程安排还留在当年的行程表里，没有被照片证实。",
            "en": "An overnight flight from Shanghai to Chengdu, then a train to Zhenjiangguan. The photos move from Huanglong's terraced pools to Jiuzhaigou's lakes and waterfalls; the notes still leave part of the return route unresolved."
          },
          "backgroundImageId": "img-6205"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-02",
      "sectionId": "arrival",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-002",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "01",
            "en": "01"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "夜航抵成都",
            "en": "An Overnight Arrival"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 7 日夜 — 8 月 8 日凌晨",
            "en": "August 7 night — August 8 morning"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-003",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "这趟旅行和李子璐一家同行。行程表写着 20:45 从上海飞往成都双流，落地已经是次日 00:05；第一晚住成都东站附近的如家商旅酒店。相册凌晨一点多的照片里，桌边的调料和一锅红白分明的汤，把城市的第一段记忆留在了饭桌旁。",
              "en": "I traveled with Li Zilu and her family. The itinerary has us flying from Shanghai to Chengdu Shuangliu at 20:45, arriving at 00:05 the next day, with a first-night stay near Chengdu East. The photos taken after 1 a.m. show condiments and a divided hotpot: the earliest frames of the trip are at a table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-004",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6009",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "凌晨的餐桌和汤锅，留住抵达后的第一段时间。",
                "en": "A late-night table and hotpot mark the hours after arrival."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6012",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-03",
      "sectionId": "huanglong",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-005",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "02",
            "en": "02"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "从镇江关上山",
            "en": "Into the Mountains from Zhenjiangguan"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 8 日 · 火车、取车与松潘",
            "en": "August 8 · train, rental car and Songpan"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-006",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "出发前在 7 月 25 日买好了车票。行程表从早餐、买零食记起：09:39 的 C6006 从成都东出发，11:02 到镇江关；取车后计划开往免费的松潘古城墙，中午吃牦牛肉汤锅，再往黄龙走。照片里有黄龙入口的石碑和坡上的建筑，路程开始变得具体。",
              "en": "The train tickets had been bought on July 25. The plan begins with breakfast and snacks, then the 09:39 C6006 from Chengdu East to Zhenjiangguan at 11:02. After picking up a rental car, the plan passes Songpan's free-to-visit old city wall, with yak-beef soup pot for lunch, before continuing toward Huanglong. The Huanglong entrance stone and buildings on the hillside make the journey tangible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-007",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6020",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "走到黄龙入口，山坡上的建筑也进入了镜头。",
                "en": "At the Huanglong entrance, the hillside buildings come into view."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6022",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-04",
      "sectionId": "huanglong",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-008",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "黄龙安排在下午：行程表提醒 16:00 停止入园，门票、索道和观光车合记 1087。照片先是雾里若隐若现的池子和亭子，后来水色一层层变亮。沿着山坡看过去，钙华台地比一张俯瞰照片更有层次。",
              "en": "Huanglong was planned for the afternoon, with a 16:00 last-admission reminder and 1087 recorded for admission, cableway and sightseeing bus together. The first frames show pools and a pavilion half-hidden by mist; later the water brightens terrace by terrace. Seen along the hillside, the travertine pools reveal more layers than one panorama can hold."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-009",
          "type": "gallery",
