        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-05",
      "sectionId": "huanglong",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-011",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "走到后面，树林、浅池与水道不断换位置；同一片山色里，水有时偏浅蓝，有时透着青绿。镜头从林边的溪水走到铺开的瀑布，脚步也跟着水往前。",
              "en": "Further on, trees, shallow pools and streams trade places in the frame. Against the same mountains, the water shifts between pale blue and green. The camera moves from a stream by the woods to a broad waterfall."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-012",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6064",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "傍晚前，溪水接着铺满坡面的瀑布。",
                "en": "Before evening, a stream gives way to a waterfall across the slope."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6067",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-06",
      "sectionId": "evening",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-013",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "03",
            "en": "03"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "夜里的汤锅",
            "en": "A Hotpot at Night"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 8 日 · 前往九寨沟",
            "en": "August 8 · toward Jiuzhaigou"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-014",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "计划里，从黄龙机场一带开往九寨沟千古风情，20:30 看演出，门票记了 800；之后住九寨沟景区店的如家商旅酒店，住宿记了 932。相册没有足够的线索确认演出的时间；晚些时候拍到的一桌菜和汤锅，倒是把赶路后的夜晚留了下来。",
              "en": "The plan continues from the Huanglong Airport area toward the Jiuzhaigou Eternal Love show at 20:30, with 800 noted for tickets, then to the Home Inn near the scenic area, with 932 listed for lodging. The album cannot confirm the timing of the performance, but later photographs of dinner and hotpot do record a meal after the day's travel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-015",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6073",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "22 点后的餐桌，留住了这一天的尾声。",
                "en": "A table photographed after 10 p.m. closes the day."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6074",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-07",
      "sectionId": "jiuzhai-woods",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-016",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "04",
            "en": "04"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "走进林与海",
            "en": "Into the Woods and Lakes"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 9 日 · 九寨沟第一天",
            "en": "August 9 · first day in Jiuzhaigou"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-017",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "行程表给九寨沟留了整天：先坐观光车到诺日朗游客中心，去原始森林走三公里，再从天鹅海上车、箭竹海下车。照片从林间小路开始，随后湖面一会儿像淡绿的玻璃，一会儿映着山影。沿着水边走，比照着景点名单赶路更能看出它不断变化的颜色。",
              "en": "The itinerary sets aside a full day: sightseeing bus to Nuorilang visitor center, a three-kilometer walk through the primeval forest, then a bus from Swan Lake to Arrow Bamboo Lake. The photos start on woodland paths and move to lakes that look pale green in one frame and mirror the mountains in the next. Along the water's edge, the changing color is easier to follow than a checklist of stops."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-018",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6078",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "从林地小径走向山间湖岸。",
                "en": "From a woodland path to a lake in the mountains."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6084",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-019",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6089",
              "shape": "square"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6094",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-08",
      "sectionId": "jiuzhai-falls",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-020",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "05",
            "en": "05"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "瀑布接着湖",
            "en": "Waterfalls and Lakes"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 9 日 · 步行与乘车之间",
            "en": "August 9 · between walks and shuttle rides"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-021",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "行程表接着写熊猫海、五花海、珍珠滩瀑布，再坐车去镜海和诺日朗瀑布。相册里，有林间的层叠瀑布，也有几乎静止的蓝绿色湖面；景点的精确对应不必从每张相近的水景里猜出来。快水和静水挨在一起看，反而像这一天最清楚的节奏。",
              "en": "The notes continue through Panda Lake, Five Flower Lake and Pearl Shoal Waterfall, then a bus to Mirror Lake and Nuorilang Waterfall. The album has tiered falls among trees and almost still blue-green water; it is better not to guess a precise attraction for every similar view. Seen together, moving and quiet water give this day its clearest rhythm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-022",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6103",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "瀑布之后又回到湖边，山影逐渐展开。",
                "en": "After the falls, the path returns to the lakes and widening mountain reflections."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6110",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-023",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
