              "shape": "square"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6125",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-09",
      "sectionId": "jiuzhai-blue",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-024",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "06",
            "en": "06"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "深蓝到碧绿",
            "en": "From Deep Blue to Turquoise"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 9 日 · 沿着湖边继续走",
            "en": "August 9 · further along the lakes"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-025",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "湖水在镜头里一层层加深，倒木、树枝和云影把每一片蓝绿切成不同的形状。行程表还记了老虎海、树正瀑布和一连串海子；照片不替它们逐一认名，只把一路上真正看见的山林和水保留下来。",
              "en": "The water deepens through the photographs. Fallen trunks, branches and cloud reflections divide each shade of blue and green into a different shape. The plan also lists Tiger Lake, Shuzheng Waterfall and many more lakes. Rather than assigning every picture a name, these frames keep the mountains, trees and water as we saw them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-026",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6135",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "从湖中倒木到湍急的溪，颜色一直没有停下来。",
                "en": "From a fallen branch over the lake to rushing water, the color keeps changing."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6151",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-027",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6154",
              "shape": "square"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6168",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-10",
      "sectionId": "jiuzhai-blue",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-028",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "往后，水声又占了上风：有宽阔的瀑布，也有从树林边流过的急水。接着视线重新被远处的山和湖拉开。将瀑布和湖面放在相邻的几组照片里，比只挑一张代表九寨沟，更像那天走路的记忆。",
              "en": "Later the sound of water seems to take over again: broad falls, then fast water beside the trees. The view opens back out toward mountains and lakes. Keeping the waterfalls beside the quieter water feels closer to the memory of walking through the valley than choosing one image to stand for it all."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-029",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6176",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "雾里的山和一片亮蓝色的湖。",
                "en": "Mountains in the mist, followed by a bright blue lake."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6184",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-11",
      "sectionId": "jiuzhai-night",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-030",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "07",
            "en": "07"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "走到傍晚",
            "en": "Toward Evening"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 9 日 · 一天的收尾",
            "en": "August 9 · the end of a long day"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-031",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "接近傍晚，镜头还在蓝色湖边，之后出现了观光车、木制房间里的陈设和餐桌。行程表把当天景区项目记为 1102，晚餐记为 735；住处写着沟里的云漫山居。从湖边的木平台到最后一桌菜，这一天终于慢慢收尾。",
              "en": "Near evening, the camera is still beside blue water; later frames show a sightseeing bus, the interior of a wooden room and dinner. The notes list 1102 for the day's scenic-area entry without further breakdown, 735 for dinner, and a stay at Yunman Shanju inside the valley. From the wooden platform by the lake to the last meal, the long day winds down."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-032",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6190",
              "shape": "square",
