                "zh": "景区里的最后几幅，与晚上餐桌的照片相连。",
                "en": "The final scenic-area frames lead into the evening meal."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6192",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-033",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6194",
              "shape": "square"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6197",
