            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-12",
      "sectionId": "last-morning",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-034",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "08",
            "en": "08"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "清晨仍是水声",
            "en": "One More Morning by the Water"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 10 日 · 九寨沟第二天",
            "en": "August 10 · second day in Jiuzhaigou"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-035",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "第二天的计划是往长海方向去，走一公里看五彩池，再坐区间车回诺日朗。相册里，早上八点多先拍到大片瀑布，九点后是雾里的湖面，十点又回到溪流与蓝绿色的水。它们能确认这一天还在景区看水，却不足以逐一坐实每个景点的名字。",
              "en": "The second-day plan heads toward Long Lake, with a one-kilometer walk to Five-Color Pond and a shuttle back to Nuorilang. The dated album begins with broad waterfalls after 8 a.m., misty lake views after 9 and more streams and blue-green water at 10. It confirms another morning by the water, though not the exact name of each photographed stop."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-036",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6205",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
