      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-13",
      "sectionId": "last-morning",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-038",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "到十点左右，湖边的树、石头间的溪流和远处的山又换了几次位置。照片里没有刻意把某一处水色当作终点；一路继续看下去，蓝绿还在变。",
              "en": "Around ten, trees by the lake, water between rocks and distant mountains change places in the frame again. No single patch of blue-green is treated as the finish line; the color keeps shifting as the walk continues."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-039",
