    {
      "id": "page-14",
      "sectionId": "departure",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-041",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": {
            "zh": "章",
            "en": "Chapter"
          },
          "markerValue": {
            "zh": "09",
            "en": "09"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "路上的最后几张",
            "en": "The Last Frames"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "8 月 10 日 · 走出景区之后",
            "en": "August 10 · after the scenic area"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-042",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "下午的相册里是窗边两杯饮品，傍晚则出现蓝天下的街道、建筑和路边风车。照片在这里停下，旧行程表上的返程方式却还需要核对。",
              "en": "The afternoon album has two drinks by a window; by evening there are streets, buildings and a roadside pinwheel under blue sky. The photographs end here, while the return route in the old itinerary still needs checking."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-043",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "two",
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "img-6232",
              "shape": "square",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "下午的饮品和傍晚街景，照片在这里停下。",
                "en": "Afternoon drinks and evening streets are where the dated photographs end."
              }
            },
            {
              "imageId": "img-6239",
              "shape": "square"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "block-044",
          "type": "note",
          "title": {
            "zh": "返程还需要核对",
            "en": "The return route still needs checking"
          },
          "body": {
            "zh": "旧行程表在 8 月 10 日同时写了牟尼沟、镇江关还车、回成都东的火车和黄龙飞杭州的航班，时间互相重叠。相册只记录到这天傍晚；8 月 11—12 日也没有另外的游记材料，因此这里不替当年的自己选一条未证实的返程路线。",
            "en": "The old itinerary places Mounigou, returning the car at Zhenjiangguan, a train to Chengdu East and a flight from Huanglong to Hangzhou on the same overlapping afternoon and evening. The dated photographs end that evening; there are no separate notes for August 11–12. I cannot establish which return route actually happened."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-15",
      "sectionId": "expenses",
      "blocks": [
        {
