            "zh": "10",
            "en": "10"
          },
          "title": {
            "zh": "留在账本上的数字",
            "en": "The Numbers in the Notebook"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "行程表上的费用，未核对实际支付",
            "en": "Itinerary amounts, not verified payments"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "block-046",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "行程表留下了下面这些数字。有的写明了项目，有的只写了数额；它们未必都是最终支付，也不把互相冲突的返程交通合算成一笔旅行总额。",
              "en": "These numbers come from the itinerary. Some have named purposes and others only an amount; they are not necessarily final payments. The conflicting return options should not be rolled into a single trip total."
            }
          ]
